    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "对于无源 RLC 网络，所需状态变量的数目等于独立储能元件的数目。在典型系统中，确定系统所存储能量的状态变量组有多种选择。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "For a passive RLC network, the number of state variables required is equal to the number of independent energy-storage elements. In a typical system, there are several choices of a set of state variables that specify the energy stored in a system.",
